sequenceDiagram
    participant Agent
    participant MCP Server
    participant Context Window

    Agent->>MCP Server: Connect (session start)
    MCP Server->>Context Window: Load Tool Definitions
    Note over Context Window: kubectl_get_pods: 15,000 tokens<br/>24 more tools: ~35,000 tokens<br/>Total: ~50,000 tokens

    Agent->>MCP Server: Call kubectl_get_pods(namespace: "kafka")
    MCP Server->>Context Window: Return Full Result
    Note over Context Window: 100+ pods × 250 tokens/pod<br/>= 25,000 tokens added

    Agent->>MCP Server: Call apply_manifest(data: pods)
    Note over Context Window: Same 25,000 tokens duplicated<br/>Total: 50,000 tokens for one operation

    Note over Context Window: Result: 50,000 (initial) + 50,000 (calls)<br/>= 100,000 tokens consumed
